From b8c7ccd74211102a81b31ada8cdea46d0d916ae5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 05:34:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Earn back Resource Management's resource through the app,
 and start a circle at 1 plus its members

A campaign's circle made after members were approved (its desk or formation
state opened late) started with 1 in each of Stitch, Refresh and Train until
the seal; it now fills to 1 plus the members when it is made. Each milestone
a rise in Illumination passes waits on the circle (circles.earn_backs, a new
column) for Resource Management's earn-back, and the new gm_earn_back message
applies the circle's choice with one press and logs it. A full resource or
nothing waiting is refused; the track lowered back past a milestone takes its
earn-back away, and a refill (the advance) clears any left.

Checked: test_ws_circle, test_ws_character, test_rest_broadcasts,
test_campaigns, test_circle_rest, test_surface and test_00_startup (on a
fresh database) pass. Tests that pinned the 1-each start are flipped.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ETKqHLvkfH9k99JTnJzzKA
